@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001

### 1. GET all products from the Angular origin (allowed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Origin: http://localhost:4200

### 2. GET one product (no Origin = not a cross-origin request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1

### 3. Preflight from an ALLOWED origin
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Origin: http://localhost:4200
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: content-type

### 4. Preflight from a BLOCKED origin
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Origin: http://evil-site.com
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: content-type

### 5. POST a new product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Origin: http://localhost:4200
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Monitor",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "price": 9500,
  "stock": 20
}

### 6. Short-circuit middleware (expect 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin

### 7. Endpoint with [DisableCors] (200, but no Access-Control-Allow-Origin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/internal
Origin: http://localhost:4200

### 8. PUT - update product 2
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/2
Origin: http://localhost:4200
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Mouse",
  "category": "Accessories",
  "price": 799,
  "stock": 80
}

### 9. DELETE - remove product 3
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/3
Origin: http://localhost:4200

### 10. Validation error (expect 400 with an errors list)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": 0
}
### 11. Place an order (expect 201 with "orderNumber": "KY-1001")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Origin: http://localhost:4200
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "size": "M", "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": 4, "size": "S", "quantity": 2 }
  ],
  "address": {
    "fullName": "Test Customer",
    "mobile": "9876543210",
    "pincode": "411005",
    "city": "Pune",
    "state": "Maharashtra",
    "house": "Flat 302, Lotus Apartments",
    "area": "FC Road, Shivajinagar",
    "landmark": "",
    "addressType": "Home"
  },
  "paymentMethod": "COD"
}

### 12. Read the order back, then check the kurta set's stock went from 25 to 24
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1001

### 13. Sold-out product (expect 400: the chinos have no stock)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [ { "productId": 9, "size": "32", "quantity": 1 } ],
  "address": {
    "fullName": "Test Customer", "mobile": "9876543210", "pincode": "411005",
    "city": "Pune", "state": "Maharashtra", "house": "Flat 302", "area": "FC Road",
    "addressType": "Home"
  },
  "paymentMethod": "COD"
}

### 14. Bad address (expect 400 with mobile and pincode messages)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [ { "productId": 4, "size": "M", "quantity": 1 } ],
  "address": {
    "fullName": "Test Customer", "mobile": "12345", "pincode": "0000",
    "city": "Pune", "state": "Maharashtra", "house": "Flat 302", "area": "FC Road",
    "addressType": "Home"
  },
  "paymentMethod": "COD"
}
### 15. Dashboard numbers (expect ordersToday 3, waitingToPack 2, onTheWay 2, soldOut 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/summary

### 16. All orders, newest first (KY-1006 at the top)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders

### 17. Pack order 1006 (expect 200 with "status": "Packed" and a second History entry)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1006/status
Origin: http://localhost:4200
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Packed" }

### 18. Cancel order 1005 (expect 200; the linen shirt's stock goes from 30 to 31)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1005/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Cancelled" }

### 19. Change a delivered order (expect 400: "This order is delivered...")
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1001/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Placed" }

### 20. Cancel a shipped order (expect 400: "A shipped order can't be cancelled.")
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1003/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Cancelled" }

### 21. Unknown status (expect 400: the JSON value could not be converted)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1004/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Lost" }

### 22. The old blocked path still says no (expect 403 from the Day 17 middleware)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/summary